WEBVTT

00:04.420 --> 00:05.350
Nox!

00:07.920 --> 00:08.810
Cheep?

00:13.240 --> 00:14.890
Talk about birds of a feather.

00:14.890 --> 00:18.860
Indeed. I knew she'd been training Nox, 
but to think they've made so much progress...

00:18.860 --> 00:21.740
Lady Nefertima is truly full of surprises.

00:22.050 --> 00:24.300
We're already best fwiends!

00:24.300 --> 00:25.660
Cheep!

00:25.990 --> 00:29.240
Why don't we try having
 Nox fly even further tomorrow?

00:30.950 --> 00:31.960
Cheep.

00:32.960 --> 00:34.360
Is something wrong?

00:34.360 --> 00:37.820
I might not be able to come by much anymore.

00:39.200 --> 00:42.080
I have to stawt studying...

00:51.900 --> 00:56.740
<b><i>Fluffy Paradise</i></b>

02:13.270 --> 02:18.240
<b><i>Episode 4   I Hate Studying!</i></b>

02:18.300 --> 02:19.650
Marjace!

02:19.650 --> 02:23.770
I've brought the tutor you'll 
be working with starting today.

02:24.450 --> 02:28.710
I am Annalee Dessa. It is a pleasure 
to make your acquaintance.

02:28.710 --> 02:31.210
<i>Whoa, a perfect bow!</i>

02:31.920 --> 02:33.660
<i>Minimal makeup...</i>

02:34.180 --> 02:37.120
<i>Prim and proper clothes and hair...</i>

02:37.490 --> 02:40.120
<i>She's like a picture-perfect lady!</i>

02:40.120 --> 02:42.580
It's a pleasure to meet you, too.

02:47.240 --> 02:50.620
I shall go get some tea ready.

02:52.010 --> 02:53.750
Lady Nefertima.

02:54.430 --> 02:58.650
We will first have to work 
on your manner of speech.

02:58.650 --> 03:01.110
<b>Manner of speech?</b>

02:59.060 --> 03:00.710
My speech?

03:01.300 --> 03:04.370
<i>All I said was that it's nice to meet her...</i>

03:03.130 --> 03:05.820
According to your butler Marjace,

03:05.820 --> 03:09.280
you address your parents as
"Papa" and "Mama."

03:09.610 --> 03:11.530
<i>Oh, that's what she meant.</i>

03:13.460 --> 03:15.420
Ow!

03:15.680 --> 03:18.390
I expect to hear a proper response.

03:19.640 --> 03:21.350
<i>What the heck was that for?!</i>

03:21.700 --> 03:23.810
And why, pray tell, are you glaring?

03:24.370 --> 03:26.150
You are a noble lady.

03:26.150 --> 03:29.480
You must never let your emotions 
show under any circumstances.

03:32.110 --> 03:34.090
Pardon me.

03:34.090 --> 03:37.280
Oh? I see you're getting along already.

03:37.280 --> 03:41.500
Indeed. I'm sure we'll be fast friends.

03:43.110 --> 03:45.780
<i>Th-This lady is </i>definitely<i> my enemy!</i>

03:45.780 --> 03:50.370
<i>And so my Spartan lessons
 with Annalee began...</i>

03:51.290 --> 03:53.080
You have poor posture.

03:53.940 --> 03:55.550
Always keep smiling!

03:56.320 --> 03:58.670
Why can't you do this?!

03:59.280 --> 04:01.150
That's all for today.

04:02.600 --> 04:04.200
And what do you say?

04:04.970 --> 04:05.670
Yes, ma'am...

04:06.940 --> 04:09.080
I see you've learned the basics,

04:09.080 --> 04:11.150
but I still have so much to teach you.

04:11.430 --> 04:16.090
I taught Lord Ralfreed and Lady Karnadia,

04:16.090 --> 04:19.100
and they were both such talented students.

04:19.610 --> 04:24.370
I shall also turn you into a 
proper lady, Lady Nefertima.

04:24.370 --> 04:25.620
<i>Eek!</i>

04:27.920 --> 04:29.660
I'm all tiwed...

04:30.780 --> 04:32.750
<i>Man, I'm so annoyed!</i>

04:32.750 --> 04:36.460
<i>There's no way that she treated 
Ralf or Karna like this.</i>

04:37.500 --> 04:40.940
<i>Wait... Is she making a fool of me?</i>

04:43.710 --> 04:46.990
<i>I'm sure Papa would take care 
of things if I told him, but...</i>

04:46.990 --> 04:49.020
<i>How dare she?!</i>

04:47.950 --> 04:50.190
<i>Yeah, we can all see that coming.</i>

04:51.690 --> 04:54.310
That's it! I'm not gonna let her win!

04:54.310 --> 04:55.090
Cheep.

04:55.610 --> 04:58.520
<i>Bring it on, lady!</i>

05:00.040 --> 05:03.530
How many times must I tell 
you this, Lady Nefertima?

05:03.790 --> 05:05.980
You are slouching yet again.

05:06.990 --> 05:08.430
What is the matter?

05:09.150 --> 05:13.400
Thank you for your guidance. 
I will be more careful in the future.

05:14.630 --> 05:18.330
Well, as long as you understand...

05:18.590 --> 05:20.560
<i>Don't underestimate my business smile</i>

05:20.560 --> 05:24.060
<i>and the feigned obsequiousness
I learned at work in my last life!</i>

05:24.830 --> 05:28.730
Now, let us study some history.

05:28.730 --> 05:30.520
Yes, ma'am.

05:31.570 --> 05:35.270
<i>But I don't know how long 
I can keep this up...</i>

05:38.180 --> 05:40.140
Thank you for the meal.

05:45.950 --> 05:50.120
What's wrong with Neema? 
She always cleans her plate.

05:50.120 --> 05:52.660
Maybe she has a stomachache.

05:57.210 --> 06:03.040
Neema. If you aren't feeling well,
 let's have a doctor take a look at you.

06:03.040 --> 06:05.440
Huh?! <i>A d-doctor?!</i>

06:06.370 --> 06:09.470
I-I'm fine. There's nuffing wrong with me.

06:09.760 --> 06:11.730
Still, just in case.

06:11.730 --> 06:13.240
But I'm fine!

06:13.240 --> 06:13.920
Neema!

06:14.260 --> 06:16.570
<i>I mean, there's nothing wrong with me!</i>

06:16.570 --> 06:21.210
<i>If Mama catches me, she definitely won't let 
me leave until I tell her about Annalee!</i>

06:22.790 --> 06:24.100
Caught you.

06:24.760 --> 06:28.420
Ralf! No fair using magic!

06:28.420 --> 06:31.390
You can fuss at me all you want later.

06:31.390 --> 06:32.650
More importantly,

06:32.650 --> 06:36.750
you should probably think about what 
you're going to tell Mother right now.

06:38.550 --> 06:40.180
Neema...

06:41.770 --> 06:45.040
<i>She's ten billion times scarier
 than Annalee Dessa!</i>

06:45.320 --> 06:50.330
The reason you've been acting strange lately 
is because of Annalee Dessa, right?

06:50.330 --> 06:51.080
<i>She got me!</i>

06:51.450 --> 06:53.710
Why won't you just talk to me about it?

06:55.000 --> 06:57.300
'Cause I can fight my own fights.

06:57.630 --> 07:00.150
So you don't want us to interfere?

07:00.150 --> 07:02.370
Well, you'd make her quit, wouldn't you?!

07:03.690 --> 07:05.230
Yes, but...

07:07.600 --> 07:09.950
Do you have a strategy to defeat Annalee?

07:09.950 --> 07:10.820
A strategy?

07:11.070 --> 07:13.540
She's known for being a perfect lady,

07:13.540 --> 07:15.980
so you won't be able 
to best her with etiquette.

07:16.490 --> 07:17.760
If you challenge her,

07:17.760 --> 07:20.620
you must do so on your terms
or you won't stand a chance.

07:21.200 --> 07:25.280
Neema, learn everything 
you can from Annalee.

07:25.280 --> 07:27.490
You must know your opponent well,

07:27.490 --> 07:30.720
or she won't even bother taking 
this fight seriously.

07:31.430 --> 07:34.810
So you're saying that I hafta get
Annalee to acknowledge me?

07:36.150 --> 07:37.760
Do you think you can, Neema?

07:39.580 --> 07:41.270
I'll help you out.

07:44.480 --> 07:46.600
Lute Cresiolle.

07:49.600 --> 07:51.260
<i>It feels so warm!</i>

07:51.260 --> 07:53.880
<i>My whole body feels lighter.</i>

07:56.250 --> 08:00.500
If you ever feel drained again,
 I'll use magic to heal you.

08:00.500 --> 08:02.090
I'll also be your dance partner.

08:02.090 --> 08:03.610
But...

08:03.610 --> 08:06.530
Don't worry. I promise I won't interfere.

08:07.560 --> 08:12.030
I just want to help you blossom 
into a lovely lady, Neema.

08:12.030 --> 08:14.680
<i>He knows exactly how to handle me!</i>

08:15.150 --> 08:18.110
We'll keep this a secret 
from Dayle and Karna.

08:18.110 --> 08:21.960
So... go fight your heart out, Neema.

08:23.980 --> 08:25.040
'Kay!

08:26.050 --> 08:28.170
<i>All right! I'm gonna do this!</i>

08:28.170 --> 08:31.290
<i>I'm </i>will<i> make Annalee acknowledge me!</i>

08:31.570 --> 08:34.780
One Year Later

08:33.320 --> 08:34.790
Wow, Neema!

08:35.630 --> 08:37.150
Hello, everyone.

08:37.890 --> 08:39.500
Good day to you all.

08:39.500 --> 08:42.820
I can't believe how much 
you've grown in a year...

08:47.000 --> 08:49.710
Amazing! You're magnificent, Neema!

08:49.710 --> 08:51.700
It's all thanks to Madam Dessa's guidance.

08:51.990 --> 08:54.240
I'm very proud.

08:54.240 --> 08:56.160
I'd expect no less from a fine young lady

08:56.160 --> 08:59.080
of the Osphes, who are so close
 with the royal family.

08:59.080 --> 09:02.600
<i>Annalee carries herself so beautifully,</i>

09:02.600 --> 09:05.720
<i>but she just doesn't strike
 me as a real lady.</i>

09:05.720 --> 09:07.780
<i>What's this awkwardness I'm feeling?</i>

09:09.320 --> 09:11.900
<i>You must know your opponent well.</i>

09:18.650 --> 09:20.000
Say, Paul...

09:21.170 --> 09:23.860
Tell me about Madam Annalee.

09:27.260 --> 09:29.480
When we were hiring her as a tutor,

09:29.480 --> 09:32.010
I looked into Annalee Dessa.

09:32.010 --> 09:34.130
But I found nothing of concern.

09:34.360 --> 09:38.620
That said... some of her relatives are ardent
believers in the Church of Divine Creation.

09:39.300 --> 09:42.610
The Church of Divine Creation? Wasn't that...

09:42.970 --> 09:47.850
<i>I believe it was the will 
of the God of Divine Creation.</i>

09:48.100 --> 09:50.690
<i>They're the church with that lousy priest</i>

09:50.690 --> 09:53.420
<i>who kept yapping like 
he was a messenger from God.</i>

09:53.820 --> 09:59.280
<i>I get it now. This awkwardness
I'm feeling might be because...</i>

09:59.530 --> 10:04.240
So as you can see, there are numerous 
countries surrounding the Kingdom of Gaché,

10:04.240 --> 10:05.740
all with different climates.

10:06.250 --> 10:07.690
Say, Madam Annalee,

10:07.690 --> 10:11.160
I heard that Icoux to the southwest
of us is struggling due to a drought.

10:11.410 --> 10:13.510
How very knowledgeable of you.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.630
<i>This summer, Icoux suffered a drought,</i>

10:16.630 --> 10:19.590
<i>which killed the harvest 
and led to a food shortage.</i>

10:20.000 --> 10:23.550
<i>They went to neighboring nations
 and the Church for help.</i>

10:23.800 --> 10:28.240
<i>In the end, our kingdom along with two 
other countries decided to provide aid.</i>

10:28.240 --> 10:29.280
<i>But...</i>

10:29.750 --> 10:32.990
Why hasn't the Church of Divine Creation
 done anything for them?

10:32.990 --> 10:35.730
Icoux is clearly struggling, 
so they should help.

10:38.620 --> 10:42.370
Unfortunately, Icoux has angered God.

10:42.370 --> 10:45.180
As messengers of God, 
if members of the Church helped them,

10:45.180 --> 10:47.360
they would be going against God's will.

10:47.660 --> 10:50.830
How are you so sure that the 
drought was divine punishment?

10:51.090 --> 10:54.280
Because our priestesses received 
a divine revelation from God.

10:54.680 --> 10:55.710
<i>Your priestesses?</i>

10:56.490 --> 11:00.380
<i>You sure the Church of Divine 
Creation didn't just make it up?</i>

11:02.290 --> 11:05.420
But were not all people created 
by the God of Divine Creation?

11:05.420 --> 11:08.480
It doesn't make any sense 
to kill them as punishment.

11:08.480 --> 11:12.410
Icoux is a barbaric country that 
harbors the likes of beastpeople.

11:12.410 --> 11:14.910
Who knows what they may 
be doing in the shadows?

11:15.180 --> 11:18.970
<i>I knew it. Annalee is... She's...</i>

11:20.660 --> 11:25.230
Have you ever met anyone or any 
beastpeople from Icoux, Madam Annalee?

11:25.230 --> 11:25.820
What?

11:27.850 --> 11:29.670
Oh, of course not.

11:30.020 --> 11:33.250
They're much too terrifying to approach.

11:33.810 --> 11:37.050
<i>This is it. This is why 
I was feeling so awkward.</i>

11:37.050 --> 11:41.840
<i>It's that discriminatory elitism 
that comes from being suckered into beliefs.</i>

11:41.840 --> 11:44.100
<i>You could hardly call her a real lady.</i>

11:44.880 --> 11:47.050
I never would have imagined...

11:48.750 --> 11:52.520
that someone like you could be so uncouth.

11:52.900 --> 11:53.730
What?

11:56.970 --> 11:58.940
Me?

11:59.370 --> 12:01.590
Uncouth?!

12:11.130 --> 12:13.360
<i>This is not education.</i>

12:13.720 --> 12:17.190
<i>This is just violence because
she's enraged that I insulted her.</i>

12:18.240 --> 12:19.910
But it's true, isn't it?

12:19.910 --> 12:25.760
I never want to become the type of vile
 person to scorn those I've never even met!

12:25.760 --> 12:30.660
Or are you trying to say that's
 a proper outlook for a noble lady?

12:30.660 --> 12:32.230
W-Well...

12:32.560 --> 12:35.660
As the daughter of Duke Osphe,

12:35.660 --> 12:39.680
I must become a fine lady who 
doesn't bring shame upon my father.

12:41.630 --> 12:47.040
A true lady shouldn't discuss boorish 
topics like politics in the first place.

12:47.040 --> 12:50.110
Then I beg your pardon,
 but what should I talk about?

12:50.400 --> 12:53.740
It's true that when ladies get together,

12:53.740 --> 12:57.100
they prefer talk of sweet shops and fashion.

12:57.420 --> 13:00.940
But are gentlemen interested in such things?

13:00.940 --> 13:02.670
Or are you suggesting

13:02.670 --> 13:05.560
I should simply stay silent
in their company like some doll?

13:06.040 --> 13:08.640
All you need to do is nod in response.

13:10.250 --> 13:13.010
That would be just plain rude.

13:13.010 --> 13:16.570
The point of conversation
 is to better understand one another.

13:16.910 --> 13:19.010
So if what you say is true, Madam,

13:19.010 --> 13:24.540
exactly how do the ladies of this world 
entertain the gentlemen around them?

13:24.540 --> 13:26.190
W-Well...

13:41.220 --> 13:44.060
<i>I guess that's one victory for me...</i>

13:51.050 --> 13:52.960
Nox, come here.

13:52.960 --> 13:54.410
Cheep.

13:56.030 --> 13:59.510
Cheep, cheep, cheep...

14:00.000 --> 14:01.950
I'm so exhausted.

14:02.870 --> 14:05.530
<i>As for how things unfolded after that...</i>

14:05.980 --> 14:08.890
Neema! What happened to your cheek?!

14:06.870 --> 14:11.300
<i>Papa saw the mark on my cheek 
and got really mad at Annalee.</i>

14:11.300 --> 14:12.410
No!

14:12.410 --> 14:16.390
<i>But I told him not to interfere 
because it was my fight. And then...</i>

14:13.320 --> 14:15.690
No butting in!

14:17.710 --> 14:21.600
<i>He mumbled something about how
I was becoming like my mother.</i>

14:21.960 --> 14:26.050
<i>I just had him give Annalee a little warning.</i>

14:26.400 --> 14:28.780
<i>I heard she apologized</i>

14:28.780 --> 14:31.500
<i>and asked to continue as my personal tutor.</i>

14:32.440 --> 14:36.440
<i>After that, I had fewer tutoring sessions</i>

14:36.440 --> 14:40.840
<i>and started learning various 
other things besides etiquette.</i>

14:41.800 --> 14:44.290
<i>Those lessons are actually pretty fun!</i>

14:46.450 --> 14:48.360
Uwaz!

14:51.770 --> 14:54.610
<i>Our duel continues...</i>

14:54.890 --> 14:59.030
<i>but I'm doing great now that
I'm able to get some floof time in.</i>

15:01.150 --> 15:03.030
Touring the northern territory?

15:03.320 --> 15:04.150
Yes.

15:05.120 --> 15:09.650
The Osphe family is in charge of the 
northern lands of the Kingdom of Gaché.

15:10.110 --> 15:12.480
I need to go check on things there.

15:12.800 --> 15:14.930
Now that you're five,

15:14.930 --> 15:19.930
I'm told that some of your academic 
and other lessons have wound down.

15:20.280 --> 15:24.660
I figured I'd take you along so 
you can expand your horizons.

15:24.660 --> 15:25.390
What say you?

15:25.910 --> 15:27.180
I'd like to go!

15:27.180 --> 15:28.440
<i>Yay!</i>

15:28.440 --> 15:30.930
<i>If we're going north, I bet it's pretty cold!</i>

15:30.930 --> 15:34.320
<i>I'm sure there are plenty of fluffs up there!</i>

15:36.700 --> 15:39.550
A transportation spell will take us up north.

15:39.550 --> 15:41.490
This is the device we use for that.

15:41.970 --> 15:44.070
Because it's such a large-scale spell,

15:44.070 --> 15:46.670
only the palace and major cities
have such devices.

15:47.010 --> 15:48.200
Wow...

15:49.600 --> 15:51.310
Are you ready, Your Grace?

15:51.700 --> 15:52.890
Go ahead.

16:00.660 --> 16:02.070
Arsenta!

16:11.370 --> 16:14.810
<i>It doesn't look like anything changed...</i>

16:14.810 --> 16:16.860
We've been awaiting your arrival.

16:17.270 --> 16:20.040
I'm humbled you'd come all this way.

16:20.040 --> 16:23.840
I am Warnus Gilva, the proxy lord here.

16:24.220 --> 16:27.450
My daughter Nefertima will 
be accompanying us on this trip.

16:27.450 --> 16:28.830
I appreciate your hospitality.

16:29.670 --> 16:31.700
I am my father's second daughter, Nefertima.

16:31.700 --> 16:33.050
Thank you for your hospitality.

16:33.290 --> 16:35.620
My, my, such a polite young lady.

16:35.620 --> 16:37.550
Welcome to Arsenta.

16:37.550 --> 16:40.140
<i>Oh, Arsenta's the name of a place!</i>

16:40.620 --> 16:44.170
We've prepared a carriage for you. 
Please, right this way.

16:44.170 --> 16:45.600
Certainly. Thank you.

16:47.480 --> 16:48.390
Neema!

16:52.540 --> 16:54.440
Wow!

16:54.440 --> 16:56.660
<i>Snow! It's snowing!</i>

16:56.970 --> 16:59.590
<i>I've never seen it in this world before!</i>

17:03.400 --> 17:04.420
Huh?

17:05.120 --> 17:05.880
Neema!

17:07.670 --> 17:10.140
Expel the outside air and 
let the warmth be sustained.

17:12.100 --> 17:14.170
Huh? I'm not cold anymore.

17:14.800 --> 17:16.200
You can't just run off like that.

17:16.200 --> 17:18.120
The climate here isn't like the capital.

17:18.120 --> 17:19.600
You must be dressed properly.

17:19.600 --> 17:20.890
Properly how?

17:24.310 --> 17:26.090
It's so warm!

17:26.090 --> 17:28.730
Indeed, you look perfect!

17:29.040 --> 17:31.940
We'll be traveling to our 
destination by carriage

17:31.940 --> 17:34.440
since we want to make it by nightfall.

17:35.090 --> 17:36.100
Let's hurry.

17:43.160 --> 17:44.130
Take that!

17:44.130 --> 17:45.620
Oh no!

17:50.060 --> 17:53.330
One third of the northern territory 
consists of a mountain range.

17:54.110 --> 17:58.040
It might be rather cold, but that 
doesn't mean business here is suffering.

17:58.420 --> 18:00.220
The mountains provide lumber.

18:00.220 --> 18:01.530
The plains have dairy farms.

18:01.530 --> 18:05.530
And closer to the capital, 
there are crops that can survive the cold.

18:05.850 --> 18:08.740
Each region adapts as they need to.

18:09.060 --> 18:10.430
Huh...

18:10.930 --> 18:14.170
<i>Maybe this place is like 
Hokkaido or the Tohoku region.</i>

18:15.500 --> 18:20.170
<i>I hope there are a lot of yummy 
things and rare creatures around!</i>

18:21.240 --> 18:26.360
Ah, Duke Osphe! 
Thank you for traveling all this way.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.130
I am the mayor here.

18:28.130 --> 18:30.330
Please, make yourselves at home.

18:30.730 --> 18:32.210
Thank you for having us.

18:36.020 --> 18:38.000
<i>Talk about a warm welcome.</i>

18:40.010 --> 18:41.720
<i>That's interesting...</i>

18:42.060 --> 18:45.770
<i>Apparently, the snow doesn't 
pile up around here.</i>

18:45.770 --> 18:46.670
<i>I wonder why.</i>

18:55.610 --> 18:57.140
<i>How yummy!</i>

18:57.140 --> 18:59.820
<i>I had no idea giant boars were so delicious!</i>

19:00.110 --> 19:02.170
May I have seconds, please?

19:02.550 --> 19:05.070
I'm glad you like it.

19:07.390 --> 19:10.880
Your cooking is so delicious, 
ma'am. I love it!

19:10.880 --> 19:11.810
My!

19:11.810 --> 19:14.350
I'll have to do my best 
for your packed lunches tomorrow.

19:14.350 --> 19:15.670
Packed lunches?

19:15.670 --> 19:17.620
We'll be entering the forest tomorrow.

19:17.890 --> 19:21.720
It'll be very dangerous, 
so I was thinking of leaving you here.

19:22.150 --> 19:24.230
But I'd like you to help us out.

19:26.760 --> 19:30.860
Lately, there have been a lot of 
casualties from monsters in this area.

19:31.340 --> 19:34.890
We've deployed knights to cull them, 
but their numbers aren't thinning.

19:35.550 --> 19:39.410
So we're going to be building 
an outpost for the knights.

19:39.940 --> 19:42.900
I'm here this time to inspect the site

19:42.900 --> 19:45.460
and see what's going on in the forest.

19:45.460 --> 19:49.040
And I'd like for you to be our 
intermediary with the fire dragon.

19:49.340 --> 19:53.520
Intermediary? Are you going to ask him 
to eliminate all the monsters here?

19:53.850 --> 19:57.250
<i>I'm worried the whole forest 
would go up in flames...</i>

19:57.520 --> 20:00.950
No, but I'm sure he's quite 
knowledgeable about monsters.

20:00.950 --> 20:04.190
I was hoping he might be able
 to give us a clue.

20:04.510 --> 20:05.770
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

20:05.770 --> 20:08.010
In that case, I'll ask him!

20:11.690 --> 20:14.600
<i>Sol. Sol? Sol?</i>

20:15.080 --> 20:19.080
<i>Mister Sol! O great Sol?</i>

20:19.910 --> 20:22.540
You needn't call for me repeatedly.

20:22.800 --> 20:24.850
Oh! I hear Sol!

20:25.660 --> 20:30.100
So, hey, I tagged along with Papa 
to tour the territory up here...

20:30.100 --> 20:32.700
But lots of monsters have 
been killing people lately.

20:32.990 --> 20:34.850
Do you know anything about that?

20:34.850 --> 20:36.070
Monsters, eh?

20:36.710 --> 20:38.160
Where are you?

20:38.390 --> 20:41.510
Huh? Where are we?

20:42.170 --> 20:45.220
Icoff in the Gilva Proxy.

20:45.220 --> 20:47.630
He might know it as the Needle Frost Forest.

20:47.980 --> 20:52.600
How odd... There shouldn't be any 
monsters in the Needle Frost Forest.

20:52.600 --> 20:55.900
Sol says he wants to know what 
kind of monsters are here.

20:55.900 --> 20:58.820
Most of the reports seem to be about goblins.

20:59.190 --> 21:04.770
There have also been reports of kobolds 
and, very rarely, frost spiders.

21:05.200 --> 21:10.400
Sol says that the goblins and kobolds 
should live much farther south.

21:10.400 --> 21:12.700
Hmm, in that case...

21:18.460 --> 21:20.790
Maybe they're overpopulated.

21:20.790 --> 21:24.140
It's also rather curious that all 
the reports are coming from here.

21:24.480 --> 21:28.860
Hmm... It's not likely,
but it's possible the cause is man-made.

21:29.460 --> 21:32.360
Maybe someone gathered them here.

21:33.260 --> 21:37.010
Um... could there be any 
way this is God's fault?

21:37.010 --> 21:38.390
Why would he do this?

21:38.390 --> 21:39.140
Huh?!

21:39.470 --> 21:40.850
Well...

21:40.850 --> 21:43.870
<i>It's not like I can tell him 
this may be for my mission...</i>

21:45.810 --> 21:49.430
I guess we'll just have 
to rule out one thing at a time.

21:49.430 --> 21:52.110
There might be some kind of evidence.

21:50.190 --> 21:53.080
<i>He's definitely the most suspicious, though...</i>

21:53.820 --> 21:54.490
All right.

21:54.950 --> 21:57.580
There's no point sitting around 
thinking about it.

21:57.580 --> 22:00.270
Tomorrow morning, we head into the woods.

23:35.180 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.180 --> 23:40.010
<b>Surprised by the Monsters in the Forest!</b>
